<title>USA: Johnson Worldwide completes Uwatec deal.</title>
<headline>Johnson Worldwide completes Uwatec deal.</headline>
<dateline>RACINE, Wis. 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Johnson Worldwide Associates Inc said it completed its acquisition of Switzerland's Uwatec AG, a privately held maker of diving instruments.</p>
<p>&quot;While having a minimal effect on 1997 results, Uwatec is expected to have a positive impact on JWA's 1998 earnings per share,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
